WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:10.427
♪

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:11.803
[Lisa] This little reunion
about to crack

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.639
- we got the whole crew back!

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:16.058
[Dewayne] Really bitch?
A cabin in the woods?

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:17.434
