a song y'all... ♪

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.103
[Nnamdi] You still a slave
to the white man?

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:22.940
[King] Y'all got to stop calling
my wife the white man alright?

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:24.650
♪ Newness, here's the anthem ♪

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.235
♪ Put your hand up that you
shoot with ♪

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:28.987
[Allison] Ten! That is what we
do on Juneteenth!

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:29.863
(slaps)

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.323
(power outage)
- Oh hell nah!

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:32.199
[Allison] Where are you going?

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:33.575
[King] To look for the fuse box.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.035
[Dewayne] What kind of
house is this?

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:38.455
♪

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.957
[Dewayne] No, no thank you.

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:40.958
- The Blackening?

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.252
[Allison] Woah...

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:44.461
[King] Jim Crow Monopoly.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:46.046
[Shawn] Shit probably runs
on racism

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:46.964
(static)

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:49.216
[Blackening] Pick a card
and save Morgan.

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:50.175
