00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.093
(static)

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.427
(yelling)

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.972
[Blackening] Refuse to play
and she dies.

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:56.849
♪

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:58.267
- I think we have
to play the game.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.060
[Lisa] In your predicament

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.229
- the Black character is always
the first to die.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:04.565
- I will spare your lives if
you sacrifice

00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:06.191
- the person you deem
the Blackest.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.025
[Allison] The Blackest?

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.944
[Nnamdi] Nobody should
judge anybody in here.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:10.654
[Blackening] You have two
minutes to decide.

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:12.030
[King] Shanika. She say nigga
the most.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.198
[Shanika] Nigga!
- See?

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.116
Dewayne!

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:15.117
[Dewayne] Y'all can't
pick me!

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:16.451
- I'm gay.

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:17.744
[Allison] Clifton?
[Lisa] Yeah.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.121
[Clifton] I can prove I'm
not the Blackest.

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:20.873
- Prove it!
- I've never seen Friday.

00:01:20.873 --> 00:01:22.374
- [Nnamdi] The f-
- ♪

00:01:22.374 --> 00:01:23.458
I voted for Trump.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:24.376
(gasp)

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.377
What?

00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:27.212
Twice.

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:28.630
(arguing)

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.966
♪ big money, playboy,
your time's up ♪

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:32.718
[Dewayne] We need a plan.

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:34.303
-[Lisa] I'm going to say it.
-[Allison] Don't you dare!

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:35.220
- We...

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.430
- Don't say this dumb shit.

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:37.848
- We have to split up.

00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:38.891
(group moaning)

00:01:38.891 --> 00:01:39.808
(static)

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:41.226
[Blackening] Your time
has run out

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:42.811
- It's time to die.

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:44.521
(door creaking)

00:01:47.149 --> 00:01:48.066
(arrow whizzing)

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:51.987
(yelling)

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:53.822
[King] There's a crazy person
out here hunting us.

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:54.781
(glass shattering)

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:55.866
[King] You got Rosa Parks
on your shirt, right?

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:57.034
- We should be sitting
down right now?

00:01:57.034 --> 00:01:58.577
- I mean...

00:01:58.577 --> 00:01:59.703
that's exactly what she did.

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:00.954
- Nigga, shut up!

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:01.955
♪ Made you look ♪

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:02.789
(gunshot)

00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:04.541
♪ Made you look ♪

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.210
(pounding)

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:07.836
[Lisa] Why Black women got to
save everyone

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:09.588
- all the god damn time!

00:02:10.214 --> 00:02:11.548
♪ Aw, made you look ♪

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:14.051
♪

00:02:14.051 --> 00:02:15.135
-♪
-(door creaks)

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.136
[Morgan] You, stop playing.

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.846
♪

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:19.056
- I got a gun.

00:02:19.056 --> 00:02:20.057
Damn

00:02:20.641 --> 00:02:21.683
(grunts)

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:23.644
That's too DMX.
What am I doing?

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:25.646
